## AI Combat & Damage

The enemy uses a similar combat architecture to the player.

### Features

- AI attack logic
- Enemy weapon tracing
- Hit detection
- Damage application
- Enemy health system
- Health bar
- Death detection
- Level restart on death

The enemy weapon uses traces during attacks, similar to the player's weapon, allowing the same core hit-detection concept to be applied to AI-controlled combat.

### Death Flow

AI attack
↓
Weapon trace
↓
Hit Actor
↓
Apply Damage
↓
Enemy Health
↓
Health reaches 0
↓
Enemy death
